        "original_id": "63f15eff-a8d0-54d9-8052-34f5edbd1fa2",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Rod Smith, Alex Sink, David Jolly, Bill Young\n- Roles: Lieutenant Governor of Florida, Governor of Florida, U.S. Representative\n- Events: 2010 Florida gubernatorial campaign, 2014 special election, Bill Young's death\n\nFacts:\n- In 2010, Rod Smith was the Democratic nominee for Lieutenant Governor of Florida and was Alex Sink's running mate in her campaign for Governor of Florida.\n- In 2013, Bill Young died, creating a vacancy in his seat as a U.S. Representative.\n- On March 11, 2014, Alex Sink was the unsuccessful Democratic candidate in the special election to fill the vacancy created by Bill Young's death, losing to Republican David Jolly.",
